      "text": "c-ε(0)={0, 1, 2, 4, 7}\nA = {0, 1, 2, 4, 9}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, letra)) = c-ε(10) = {10, 11, 12, 13, 15, 18}\nB = {10, 11 12, 13, 15, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, digito)) = c-ε(3) = {2, 3, 4}\nC = {2, 3, 4}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, .)) = c-ε(5) = {5, 6}\nD = {5}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, letra)) = c-ε(14) = {12, 14, 17, 18}\nE = {12, 14, 17, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, digito)) = c-ε(16) = {12, 16, 17, 18}\nF = {12, 16, 17, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, .)) = c-ε() = ∅\nc-ε(mueve(C, letra)) = c-ε() = ∅\nc-ε(mueve(C, digito)) = c-ε(3) = {2, 3, 4}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "c-ε(0)={0, 1, 2, 4, 7}\nA = {0, 1, 2, 4, 9}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, letra)) = c-ε(10) = {10, 11, 12, 13, 15, 18}\nB = {10, 11 12, 13, 15, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, digito)) = c-ε(3) = {2, 3, 4}\nC = {2, 3, 4}\n\nc-ε(mueve(A, .)) = c-ε(5) = {5, 6}\nD = {5}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, letra)) = c-ε(14) = {12, 14, 17, 18}\nE = {12, 14, 17, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, digito)) = c-ε(16) = {12, 16, 17, 18}\nF = {12, 16, 17, 18}\n\nc-ε(mueve(B, .)) = c-ε() = ∅\nc-ε(mueve(C, letra)) = c-ε() = ∅\nc-ε(mueve(C, digito)) = c-ε(3) = {2, 3, 4}",
